# NexAdib first-run setup.
#
# SETUP_TOKEN is optional but recommended. When set, the /install page only accepts
# the first admin password together with this token, so nobody who discovers the
# address before you can claim the panel. Generate one with `openssl rand -hex 16`.
# Panels installed from the built-in Cloudflare account manager are claimed
# automatically and never expose an open /install window.
SETUP_TOKEN=
